{"id":1562,"date":"2026-08-23T21:25:21","date_gmt":"2026-08-23T21:25:21","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1562"},"modified":"2026-08-23T21:56:37","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T21:56:37","slug":"export-to-pdf","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/export-share\/export-to-pdf\/","title":{"rendered":"Export to PDF"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Export to PDF<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1578\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportToPDF.webp\" alt=\"Export to PDF\" width=\"83\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportToPDF.webp 665w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportToPDF-210x300.webp 210w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 83px) 100vw, 83px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher produces print-quality PDF output via the native browser Save as PDF workflow, with an automated pre-processing pipeline that ensures everything in your document &#8211; effects, crops, filters, and Master Pages &#8211; is accurately captured in the final file.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">How to Export as PDF<\/span><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>File &gt; Export to PDF<\/strong>, or click the <strong>Export PDF<\/strong> button in the Export group of the File ribbon.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A guidance dialog opens explaining the process. Open Publisher opens your system&#8217;s print menu and instructs you to select <strong>\u201cSave as PDF\u201d<\/strong> as the printer destination.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click through to generate and save the file.<\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1571\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowToExportToPDF.webp\" alt=\"How to Export as PDF\" width=\"482\" height=\"90\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowToExportToPDF.webp 1141w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowToExportToPDF-300x56.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowToExportToPDF-1024x191.webp 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowToExportToPDF-768x143.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 482px) 100vw, 482px\" \/><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">PDF Pre-Processing Pipeline<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The PDF export uses the same high-resolution print engine as standard printing, with the following<br \/>\nadditional pre-processing steps applied automatically<br \/>\nbefore the snapshot is taken:<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1568\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PrintPipeline.webp\" alt=\"PDF Pre-Processing Pipeline\" width=\"304\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PrintPipeline.webp 914w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PrintPipeline-300x145.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PrintPipeline-768x371.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 304px) 100vw, 304px\" \/><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>WordArt &#8211;<\/strong> Converted to a 1:1 PNG using the Canvas Compositor.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>CSS filters &#8211;<\/strong>\u00a0Hue rotation, brightness, contrast, and other image filters are baked into images via canvas rendering.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Shape crops, clip-paths, and 3D rotations &#8211;<\/strong> All flattened and rasterised.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Master Page headers and footers &#8211;<\/strong> Correctly applied to every page in the document.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Margin guides and selection boxes &#8211;<\/strong> Stripped from the snapshot so they never appear in the exported file.<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1565 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportingPDF-e1787520400425.webp\" alt=\"Export to High-Res PDF\" width=\"1544\" height=\"486\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportingPDF-e1787520400425.webp 1544w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportingPDF-e1787520400425-300x94.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportingPDF-e1787520400425-1024x322.webp 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportingPDF-e1787520400425-768x242.webp 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportingPDF-e1787520400425-1536x483.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1544px) 100vw, 1544px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Export to PDF Open Publisher produces print-quality PDF output via the native browser Save as PDF workflow, with an automated pre-processing pipeline that ensures everything in your document &#8211; effects, crops, filters, and Master Pages &#8211; is accurately captured in the final file. How to Export as PDF Go to File &gt; Export to PDF, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1578,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[21],"class_list":["post-1562","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-export-share"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1562","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1562"}],"version-history":[{"count":20,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1562\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1589,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1562\/revisions\/1589"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1578"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1562"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1562"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}